---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ReferencePhoto from '../../components/ReferencePhoto.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Brake assembly overview">
  <h1>Brake assembly overview</h1>
  <p>The illustration below identifies the general parts of a disc brake assembly. It is an educational overview, not an exploded Volvo parts drawing or installation instruction.</p>

  <ReferencePhoto src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Disc_brakes.jpg?width=1400" alt="Close-up photograph of a car disc brake rotor" caption="Disc brake rotor: friction surface and ventilation detail" credit="Envy fstop" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Disc_brakes.jpg" license="CC BY-SA 4.0" />

  <figure class="diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 700 390" role="img" aria-labelledby="brake-title brake-desc">
      <title id="brake-title">Simplified disc brake assembly</title>
      <desc id="brake-desc">A disc rotor passes between two brake pads held by a caliper mounted to a carrier.</desc>
      <circle cx="260" cy="190" r="128" fill="#f7f7f7" stroke="#555" stroke-width="4"/>
      <circle cx="260" cy="190" r="32" fill="#fff" stroke="#555" stroke-width="3"/>
      <circle cx="260" cy="190" r="7" fill="#555"/>
      <rect x="236" y="65" width="48" height="250" fill="#ddd" stroke="#555" stroke-width="2"/>
      <rect x="158" y="95" width="23" height="190" fill="#999" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
      <rect x="339" y="95" width="23" height="190" fill="#999" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
      <path d="M132 80 H388 Q420 80 420 112 V268 Q420 300 388 300 H362" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="14" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M420 190 H495" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="510" y="195" font-size="15">Caliper body</text>
      <path d="M360 115 L490 65" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="500" y="60" font-size="15">Brake pad</text>
      <path d="M260 315 L260 350 H420" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="430" y="355" font-size="15">Rotor / disc</text>
      <path d="M150 270 L85 325 H30" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="30" y="350" font-size="15">Caliper carrier</text>
      <text x="260" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12">Hub</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>Schematic only. Actual S60 caliper, pad, rotor, and carrier geometry varies by brake package.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <h2>Before ordering parts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Confirm the front or rear axle and brake package by VIN.</li>
    <li>Compare pad shape, rotor diameter/thickness, and hardware with the installed components.</li>
    <li>Check wear sensor and parking-brake requirements for the axle being serviced.</li>
    <li>Use the specified fasteners, lubricants, and torque values from the correct service procedure.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="../front-brake-pads/">Front brake pad replacement notes</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
